WEBVTT

01:47.080 --> 01:48.520
Your Majesty, I--

01:50.960 --> 01:56.200
Concerning Qingzhou,
the gods' will must be sought.

01:57.240 --> 01:59.240
Isn't the Prince Heir awake?

01:59.840 --> 02:03.400
- I leave it to you two.
- I am weary.

02:06.720 --> 02:07.760
Yes, Your Majesty.

02:09.880 --> 02:12.000
General, what does His Majesty
intend for Qingzhou?

02:12.080 --> 02:14.600
His Majesty, driven
by a desire for immortality,

02:14.680 --> 02:16.960
weighs Qingzhou's value in his quest.

02:17.680 --> 02:21.000
If it offers no gain, he may spare it.

02:22.200 --> 02:26.520
But with
the Prince Heir's strength proven,

02:26.600 --> 02:29.800
he now trusts him as the Sun Kunlun.

02:29.880 --> 02:33.720
So, our only path
is to gain the Prince Heir's cooperation?

02:35.200 --> 02:38.480
We must ensure he doesn't obstruct us.

02:38.560 --> 02:39.520
General!

02:40.120 --> 02:42.160
General, news from Qingzhou.

02:44.000 --> 02:45.640
OCTOBER, 26TH YEAR OF ZHAOMING
FROM ZIGU

02:48.520 --> 02:51.040
If this woman is truly the Princess Heir,

02:51.800 --> 02:54.680
then the Prince Heir will be my pawn.

02:55.920 --> 02:59.400
I am resolved to conquer Qingzhou.

03:06.120 --> 03:10.560
Prince Jing was weakened by testing
the Momai antidote,

03:10.640 --> 03:12.640
harming both Qi and blood.

03:13.680 --> 03:15.720
You must recover fully.

03:36.480 --> 03:37.480
Wei,

03:38.360 --> 03:39.480
the medicine is not ready yet.

03:39.560 --> 03:41.320
Patience is needed.

03:44.840 --> 03:45.680
General Yin.

03:46.800 --> 03:50.360
Should I call you Mei Lin or Miss Hua?

04:00.760 --> 04:02.680
Is this medicine for the governor?

04:04.160 --> 04:06.280
Yes, to replenish his Qi and blood.

04:07.520 --> 04:09.720
But the governor's true ailment
is emotional.

04:09.800 --> 04:12.040
Only an emotional remedy
can heal his pain.

04:13.640 --> 04:15.040
Such healing must come from within.

04:16.160 --> 04:18.800
The governor was injured
while saving Miss Hua.

04:19.399 --> 04:20.839
This is what Miss Hua should do.

04:21.600 --> 04:25.200
You've done plenty
by preparing medicine for him.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.680
He's suffered long.

04:27.760 --> 04:29.440
He'll need time to fully recover.

04:30.280 --> 04:31.440
Let him endure it.

04:33.320 --> 04:36.560
General Yin,
are you here for the governor?

04:38.040 --> 04:39.600
I'm here for you.

04:40.840 --> 04:43.800
The patrol camp owes much to your aid.

04:43.880 --> 04:48.280
Your talents are wasted
in this small cake shop.

04:48.360 --> 04:51.480
Miss Hua, will you consider
joining the barracks?

04:55.160 --> 04:56.640
Thank you, General Yin,
for your kind offer.

04:57.560 --> 04:59.600
You're a national heroine, General Yin.

04:59.680 --> 05:01.120
I admire you deeply.

05:02.920 --> 05:07.080
In the past,
I'd have followed without question.

05:07.920 --> 05:09.720
Now, as Miss Hua,

05:09.800 --> 05:12.160
I'm just an ordinary Qingzhou citizen.

05:13.280 --> 05:16.160
The life I lead now is what I desire most.

05:17.640 --> 05:20.000
General Yin, when the nation faces danger,

05:20.080 --> 05:23.240
I will rise, wherever I am,

05:23.800 --> 05:26.240
to defend my country, life or death.

05:27.000 --> 05:28.080
Well spoken.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.760
I will not force you, then.

05:31.760 --> 05:35.000
Mei Lin, it's a pity we met so late.

05:36.720 --> 05:37.560
Not late at all.

05:38.240 --> 05:39.840
You arrived in time, General Yin.

05:41.000 --> 05:43.240
The governor's medicine is almost ready.

05:43.320 --> 05:45.840
Could you deliver it to the patrol camp?

05:46.560 --> 05:47.680
Very well.

06:06.160 --> 06:07.200
We must leave!

06:13.600 --> 06:16.920
Every house and shop within three li
has been doused with tung oil.

06:17.000 --> 06:19.760
Resist us, and all will perish with you!

06:24.960 --> 06:25.840
- Halt!
- Halt!

06:28.400 --> 06:29.920
You're from Xiyan.

06:30.000 --> 06:32.400
We're here to escort the Princess Heir
back to Xiyan.

06:32.480 --> 06:36.120
Since you're here, General Yin,
you'll accompany us.

06:36.200 --> 06:37.200
You don't serve the Prince Heir.

06:37.800 --> 06:41.000
Here, Prince Heir's token.
Qingzhou's governor will understand.

06:41.080 --> 06:42.080
Mei Lin!

07:07.800 --> 07:10.440
There's still time
before the young prince arrives.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.440
Take your time on the sculpture,
Your Highness.

07:13.120 --> 07:15.080
- There's still time.
- No, there's no time.

07:16.880 --> 07:18.280
I can never make it.

07:20.960 --> 07:22.040
Zigu…

07:24.480 --> 07:25.600
is gone.

07:29.520 --> 07:30.880
Her Highness?

07:31.520 --> 07:33.200
- Did the secret message…?
- Out.

07:33.280 --> 07:35.160
- Your Highness.
- Out!

08:05.480 --> 08:07.560
Zigu was loyal,

08:08.080 --> 08:10.360
and you failed her.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.560
She wasn't even 20.

08:18.960 --> 08:20.480
Why did you do this?

08:22.200 --> 08:23.440
Why?

08:23.520 --> 08:24.760
Why?

08:24.840 --> 08:26.040
Why?

08:26.120 --> 08:29.080
All I wanted was to protect those I love,

08:29.160 --> 08:32.559
and they're all gone!

08:32.640 --> 08:35.280
Mother, Zigu,

08:37.039 --> 08:38.400
and Mei Lin.

08:50.560 --> 08:52.880
You were blind and foolish then.

08:56.240 --> 08:58.520
The fault was mine.

09:01.600 --> 09:04.400
I should bear the punishment.

09:06.720 --> 09:09.520
I should be dead.

09:36.400 --> 09:37.280
Please calm your anger, Your Majesty.

09:37.360 --> 09:38.240
Your Majesty.

09:38.320 --> 09:40.600
- Your Majesty, take care of your health.
- Silence!

09:42.800 --> 09:46.440
I'm the son of Heaven. I won't die.

09:47.400 --> 09:49.640
Seek the Moon Kunlun.

09:50.240 --> 09:55.000
Only when the Sun and Moon Kunlun unite
will I attain immortality.

09:55.600 --> 09:59.480
Also, light another lamp

10:00.400 --> 10:03.320
at the Tower of Immortality.

10:04.160 --> 10:07.880
- Go!
- Yes, Your Majesty.

10:14.760 --> 10:18.320
Does the new priest
still lack His Majesty's trust?

10:18.400 --> 10:24.080
His Majesty is ever-suspicious,
and no priest can cure him.

10:24.160 --> 10:26.800
His Majesty can't afford to wait.

10:26.880 --> 10:28.520
Send the High Priest to declare

10:29.040 --> 10:31.680
that Qingzhou's Sacred Mountain
holds immortality.

10:32.320 --> 10:34.360
We must secure orders to attack Qingzhou

10:34.440 --> 10:36.920
before His Majesty weakens.

10:37.000 --> 10:37.840
Yes.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.480
ORDER

10:39.560 --> 10:41.880
Last night, Mei Lin brewed medicine
to restore your Qi and blood,

10:41.960 --> 10:43.480
refusing help.

10:43.560 --> 10:45.040
How could this happen?

10:45.640 --> 10:48.400
If Jia and Yi learn
Mei Lin has been taken,

10:48.480 --> 10:49.480
they'll be frantic.

10:49.560 --> 10:52.200
Fear not. I'll rescue her.

10:54.520 --> 10:56.280
All houses within three lis
are doused in tung oil.

10:57.640 --> 10:59.520
This isn't the Prince Heir's way.

11:02.000 --> 11:04.560
It's Mingju. He seized them
under the Prince Heir's name,

11:04.640 --> 11:05.800
likely to force the Prince Heir
into battle.

11:05.880 --> 11:07.400
The general is in danger.

11:08.040 --> 11:08.880
Return to the barracks.

11:14.800 --> 11:15.960
This way, Your Excellency.

11:16.040 --> 11:18.400
LIKE THE CONSTANT SUN

11:18.480 --> 11:21.680
General, His Highness is unwell
and refuses visitors.

11:22.280 --> 11:26.800
I bring the remedy he needs,
one that calms the Prince Heir's heart.

11:37.200 --> 11:38.280
Inform him.

11:38.360 --> 11:43.040
Seeing her will cure the Prince Heir
more than any medicine.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.360
Where is she?

12:06.160 --> 12:08.040
Once lost, and now returned.

12:08.120 --> 12:10.440
Do I not deserve a gift of thanks,
Your Highness?

12:10.520 --> 12:13.440
Take me to her. I must see her first.

12:33.720 --> 12:38.320
Keep watch on them.
Report all they say and do.

12:38.400 --> 12:39.240
Yes.

12:51.520 --> 12:52.560
Mei Lin,

12:53.360 --> 12:54.560
it truly is you.

12:56.320 --> 12:57.760
I'm grateful you're alive.

12:58.360 --> 12:59.320
Fear not.

13:01.400 --> 13:02.920
I won't force you again.

13:03.960 --> 13:06.920
I can't bear to let you die a second time.

13:08.880 --> 13:11.520
I will send you back to Qingzhou.

13:50.960 --> 13:51.840
Mei Lin.

13:59.960 --> 14:00.840
Don't be afraid.

14:02.160 --> 14:03.840
I won't hurt anyone anymore.

14:04.520 --> 14:06.440
You can't hurt yourself anymore.

14:07.080 --> 14:09.240
I will find more Snow Dragon Whisker
to save you.

14:10.240 --> 14:11.880
The Snow Dragon Whisker was an accident.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.720
I don't blame you.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.800
Stop blaming yourself.

14:20.560 --> 14:21.520
Your Highness,

14:23.360 --> 14:24.520
let me go.

14:26.440 --> 14:29.480
I only wish to live in peace.

14:41.280 --> 14:45.080
You're the Princess Heir.
Your home is in Xiyan.

14:45.160 --> 14:47.240
I'm no longer the Princess Heir.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.240
You and I have parted ways.

14:48.320 --> 14:49.440
I regret it.

14:50.320 --> 14:53.240
Now that you live, you must stay here.

14:53.920 --> 14:54.760
If you are to die,

14:55.680 --> 14:57.040
let it be by my side.

15:00.800 --> 15:01.640
Your Highness,

15:04.120 --> 15:07.160
I owe you my life,

15:07.240 --> 15:10.320
but I cannot return your love.

15:10.400 --> 15:12.000
You have no choice.

15:12.880 --> 15:17.440
I hold Yin Luomei.
If you wish her safe, stay.

15:27.360 --> 15:28.200
Your Highness,

15:29.600 --> 15:30.840
General Ming requests your presence.

15:43.880 --> 15:44.840
Your Highness.

15:49.960 --> 15:52.360
General Ming, what do you want as thanks?

15:53.080 --> 15:54.800
Your Highness, take a seat.

16:01.320 --> 16:06.200
Your Highness,
you know well my desired thanks.

16:09.280 --> 16:10.240
Very well.

16:10.320 --> 16:15.840
I'll help you seize Qingzhou,
but release Yin Luomei first.

16:17.040 --> 16:20.040
With her in hand, why release her?

16:20.640 --> 16:22.160
Better to execute her

16:22.240 --> 16:24.960
before the armies, rallying our troops.

16:25.040 --> 16:28.520
Yin Luomei is but a minor sheriff.

16:28.600 --> 16:31.640
Her death would only trouble our men.

16:31.720 --> 16:34.720
But Murong Jinghe's fall

16:36.240 --> 16:39.160
will deliver Qingzhou without a fight.

16:45.760 --> 16:46.840
Where's the Prince Heir?

16:46.920 --> 16:49.320
Tell him that I will stay,

16:51.280 --> 16:53.200
but he must let General Yin return.

16:53.280 --> 16:55.320
Release Yin Luomei as bait.

16:56.560 --> 16:59.520
Murong Jinghe's death is paramount.

17:00.800 --> 17:02.240
Stalling tactics.

17:04.040 --> 17:06.160
Send word to Weibei Army's camp

17:06.240 --> 17:09.240
that Yin Luomei was caught
spying on Xiyan's camp.

17:09.319 --> 17:12.640
Out of regard for peace,
I will overlook it,

17:12.720 --> 17:14.160
but I require Qingzhou's governor

17:14.240 --> 17:17.440
- to fetch her at Liucui River.
- Yes, Your Highness.

17:19.319 --> 17:22.119
If Mingju and Yue Qin are allied,
it could prove problematic.

17:23.680 --> 17:25.480
Choose a trusted team

17:25.560 --> 17:28.319
from the Pingnan Army
to assist in their rescue.

17:29.600 --> 17:33.040
Also, keep General Yin's absence secret.

17:33.120 --> 17:33.960
Understood.

17:35.560 --> 17:38.160
Enemy sighted! Enemy sighted!

17:39.240 --> 17:40.360
Enemy sighted!

17:42.880 --> 17:46.480
YIN LUOMEI CAUGHT SPYING. GOVERNOR
TO RETRIEVE HER AT LIUCUI RIVER, WU HOUR

17:47.360 --> 17:48.320
Qingyan.

18:02.120 --> 18:04.160
"Yin Luomei was caught spying.

18:04.920 --> 18:09.200
Qingzhou's governor is to collect her
at Liucui River at Wu hour."

18:12.160 --> 18:16.320
Now, I only wish the Princess Heir
would stay in Xiyan willingly.

18:17.840 --> 18:21.440
Alas, her heart belongs to Murong Jinghe.

18:32.520 --> 18:35.520
It seems Xiyan seeks a reason
to break the treaty and ignite war.

18:35.600 --> 18:36.440
Let us fight them.

18:37.320 --> 18:41.280
The General said the Pingnan Army
does not seek war, yet fears it not.

18:42.240 --> 18:43.680
Kill the Xiyan soldiers, save the General!

18:44.280 --> 18:45.600
Kill the Xiyan soldiers, save the General!

18:45.680 --> 18:47.600
Kill the Xiyan soldiers, save the General!

18:47.680 --> 18:49.480
Kill the Xiyan soldiers, save the General!

18:49.560 --> 18:51.080
Kill the Xiyan soldiers, save the General!

18:51.160 --> 18:52.840
Kill the Xiyan soldiers, save the General!

18:52.920 --> 18:54.000
We cannot engage them.

18:54.080 --> 18:55.840
With the decree and the treaty,

18:55.920 --> 18:57.600
we should not be the first to declare war.

18:58.560 --> 19:01.040
Moreover, Xiyan's excuse is sound.

19:01.120 --> 19:03.400
I believe we should follow their words.

19:04.000 --> 19:06.160
His Excellency can go to retrieve her.

19:06.240 --> 19:08.960
No, it's likely a trap.

19:09.040 --> 19:10.120
I agree.

19:10.200 --> 19:12.880
If His Excellency and the General
fall into danger,

19:12.960 --> 19:14.920
Qingzhou will be left defenseless.

19:15.800 --> 19:16.640
Your Excellency, let me go.

19:16.720 --> 19:19.400
Even if it costs my life, I'll bring back
General Yin and Miss Hua.

19:19.480 --> 19:21.920
Miss Hua is less important.
General Yin is crucial.

19:22.000 --> 19:24.440
Over half of Qingzhou's troops

19:25.480 --> 19:28.000
are former Pingnan Army.

19:29.120 --> 19:30.640
Choose a team to rescue them.

19:31.880 --> 19:32.720
I'll lead.

19:51.000 --> 19:54.160
Be assured, General.
I release you with a sincere heart.

19:54.840 --> 19:58.200
But wait a while
for Qingzhou's governor to fetch you.

20:01.000 --> 20:03.360
I will use Yin Luomei to put on a show

20:03.440 --> 20:04.800
to have Mei Lin's spirit broken.

20:05.840 --> 20:10.080
Therefore, Murong Jinghe
must die by my hand.

20:12.360 --> 20:15.360
A clever ruse, Your Highness.

20:17.800 --> 20:20.720
I want her to stay and her heart, too.

20:20.800 --> 20:23.560
Aid me, General Ming,

20:23.640 --> 20:26.320
and Qingzhou will be my gift to you.

20:26.400 --> 20:30.000
Qingzhou is the Princess Heir's homeland.

20:30.720 --> 20:33.240
Your Highness, so deeply in love with her…

20:34.560 --> 20:39.600
Why should I believe you'll give it to me?

20:42.760 --> 20:48.320
General Ming, your soldiers outside
follow the gods.

20:48.840 --> 20:51.000
Without the gods' blessing,

20:51.720 --> 20:54.840
do you think they will
follow you into battle?

20:57.640 --> 21:00.520
Your Highness.
I know you didn't remain willingly.

21:01.040 --> 21:03.640
I offer another chance to leave.

21:03.720 --> 21:06.920
You aim to incite war between nations.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.880
I merely wish to watch a show.

21:10.680 --> 21:14.320
Tell the governor
I await him with my beloved wife.

21:14.920 --> 21:16.440
He must come alone.

21:17.520 --> 21:18.360
Yes.

21:43.840 --> 21:46.320
Your Excellency, ̀how are you?

21:46.400 --> 21:49.360
If you seek peace, release them now.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.360
I shall.

21:51.280 --> 21:53.920
Yet, General Yin and her men
spied on Xiyan's camp.

21:54.000 --> 21:57.440
I must retain one as a pretext
for the army.

21:57.520 --> 21:59.840
Which one remains is your choice,

21:59.920 --> 22:01.480
Your Excellency.

22:01.560 --> 22:03.000
You break your word.

22:03.080 --> 22:05.200
I pledged to release General Yin,

22:05.840 --> 22:07.080
not both of them.

22:08.160 --> 22:11.080
Since this lady is dear to you,

22:11.720 --> 22:14.160
I bring you together, Your Excellency.

22:14.240 --> 22:16.520
You should thank me.

22:17.120 --> 22:19.200
- Why should I trust you?
- Choose Mei Lin.

22:19.280 --> 22:22.440
You know I'd never harm her.

22:32.480 --> 22:37.760
I'm the Sun Kunlun, under the gods' favor.

22:37.840 --> 22:39.520
Moreover,

22:40.360 --> 22:43.240
as Prince Heir

22:44.360 --> 22:47.280
and future king,

22:47.360 --> 22:50.840
I need not break my word to any subject.

23:01.240 --> 23:02.120
I'm sorry.

23:04.960 --> 23:06.000
Yin Luomei, come with me.

23:07.760 --> 23:08.920
Your Excellency,

23:09.000 --> 23:10.960
it seems you hold General Yin dearer.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.840
General Yin, depart now.

23:14.040 --> 23:16.840
You've made your choice. Don't be greedy,

23:16.920 --> 23:18.640
or you'll lose both.

23:20.680 --> 23:23.760
General, do you truly
trust the Prince Heir?

23:24.640 --> 23:26.200
With His Majesty gravely ill,

23:26.280 --> 23:29.520
I comply with the Prince Heir for now.

23:29.600 --> 23:32.000
But as long as his heart remains in Xiyan,

23:32.880 --> 23:34.440
he'll keep his promise.

23:37.200 --> 23:38.960
Mei Lin, see?

23:39.040 --> 23:40.480
He abandoned you once more.

23:42.160 --> 23:44.000
I knew he'd choose General Yin.

23:46.080 --> 23:49.080
General Weibei values loyalty
but upholds justice, above all.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.680
He's unworthy of your sympathy!

23:56.040 --> 23:58.400
Only I will always choose you.

24:05.480 --> 24:07.920
Murong Jinghe must die here.

24:08.760 --> 24:09.600
Release the arrows!

24:10.880 --> 24:12.200
Stop!

24:17.560 --> 24:19.480
- No one moves!
- Stop!

24:20.680 --> 24:23.880
Any who harm the Princess Heir
will be cut down by me.

24:29.520 --> 24:32.880
So, the Prince Heir has been
playing his part all along.

24:34.560 --> 24:36.480
I'm the Sun Kunlun.

24:36.560 --> 24:39.200
If I fall, you all fall with me!

24:48.440 --> 24:49.320
Yin Luomei, heed my command.

24:49.400 --> 24:53.960
If I perish,
lead the Weibei Army to protect Qingzhou.

24:55.440 --> 24:56.400
WEIBEI

24:56.480 --> 24:57.840
Generals, listen.

24:57.920 --> 25:00.680
Without General Yin's order,
no soldier shall be deployed.

25:00.760 --> 25:02.160
Yes, General!

25:09.840 --> 25:10.760
Your Highness,

25:11.840 --> 25:12.720
take care.

25:25.440 --> 25:26.880
Mei Lin!

25:32.760 --> 25:34.040
Mei Lin!

25:50.800 --> 25:51.800
Mei Lin!

25:52.400 --> 25:53.240
Mei Lin.

25:55.280 --> 25:56.360
Mei Lin.

25:56.440 --> 25:57.800
Mei Lin. Mei Lin!

25:59.120 --> 26:00.000
Mei Lin.

26:00.880 --> 26:01.800
Mei Lin.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.920
I planned to send General Yin back first,

26:28.840 --> 26:30.520
then find a way to send you.

26:32.120 --> 26:33.240
You're as sharp as ever.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.000
Wait a moment.

26:46.960 --> 26:48.320
Qingyan will find us.

26:51.240 --> 26:52.280
Why did you return?

26:53.160 --> 26:54.880
Because I only wanted to choose you.

26:54.960 --> 26:57.680
The river is treacherous.
How could you jump?

26:57.760 --> 26:59.120
Because you did.

28:00.760 --> 28:02.000
Weibei Army, listen.

28:03.480 --> 28:05.400
Turn back and stand by.

28:06.720 --> 28:08.400
No wonder the governor's mansion
has cakes daily.

28:08.480 --> 28:10.160
He's been smitten with Miss Hua
for a long time.

28:10.960 --> 28:14.280
Right. Miss Hua may become
the governor's wife.

28:26.920 --> 28:28.200
I owe you much, Mei.

28:28.880 --> 28:31.040
I thought you'd never forgive me.

28:34.080 --> 28:35.760
Who said I forgave you?

28:40.160 --> 28:41.000
Well…

28:45.920 --> 28:47.840
This is Miss Hua's wish.

28:49.560 --> 28:51.240
She admires the governor.

28:57.080 --> 28:58.200
Miss Hua, please restrain yourself.

28:58.280 --> 29:01.960
I'm devoted to another
and will only marry her.

29:03.160 --> 29:08.120
Miss Hua, don't think resembling her
lets you near me.

29:16.240 --> 29:20.520
Mei, I'll spend my life

29:21.600 --> 29:25.040
making amends for my wrongs against you.

29:28.920 --> 29:30.040
Jinghe.

29:33.880 --> 29:35.480
Promise me one more thing,

29:36.480 --> 29:37.440
and I will forgive you.

29:39.080 --> 29:42.960
Alright. Anything. I promise.

29:45.520 --> 29:46.600
Swear that

29:49.640 --> 29:50.760
from now on,

29:53.280 --> 29:55.080
no matter what,

29:56.240 --> 29:57.640
you won't stop me.

30:00.480 --> 30:01.800
Swear that

30:03.480 --> 30:06.520
you won't harm yourself for me.

30:11.080 --> 30:12.720
I understand.

30:13.320 --> 30:15.560
Even if the same situation arises,

30:16.280 --> 30:18.680
I'll act as Qingzhou's governor.

30:19.280 --> 30:20.400
Then, I will find you.

30:21.760 --> 30:25.240
In this life, we'll share life and death.

30:28.640 --> 30:30.200
In life and in death.

30:43.320 --> 30:44.600
You're going back on your word again.

30:47.720 --> 30:49.800
I shouldn't have forgiven you.

30:52.480 --> 30:53.600
Alright.

30:55.560 --> 30:56.800
I swear.

30:58.920 --> 31:00.280
You're so stubborn.

31:01.600 --> 31:02.880
I will always listen to you.

31:04.440 --> 31:05.400
Will you promise me?

31:06.880 --> 31:07.720
I promise you.

31:22.680 --> 31:23.960
And I know

31:26.400 --> 31:28.480
you retrieved the Snow Dragon Whisker

31:32.600 --> 31:35.000
and took the poison for me.

31:42.360 --> 31:43.680
Truly,

31:45.760 --> 31:47.320
what you owed is paid.

31:51.880 --> 31:54.440
- Jinghe, from now on…
- My Lord!

31:55.520 --> 31:56.440
Miss,

31:58.720 --> 32:00.120
Concubine Yan…

32:00.720 --> 32:02.480
Concubine Yan has passed away.

32:18.240 --> 32:19.280
Father.

32:19.360 --> 32:21.480
You have come just in time.

32:21.560 --> 32:25.560
Mingju has planned to attack Qingzhou.

32:26.320 --> 32:28.240
You have lived long in Great Yan

32:28.760 --> 32:31.560
and are deeply knowledgeable
in Qingzhou affairs.

32:31.640 --> 32:34.040
Go with the army

32:34.680 --> 32:36.120
and aid Mingju

32:36.720 --> 32:38.520
in seizing Qingzhou.

32:38.600 --> 32:42.040
Your Majesty, I fear His Highness,
devoted to his sister,

32:42.120 --> 32:43.680
may lack commitment.

32:46.080 --> 32:49.400
Zigu was wed to Great Yan.

32:49.480 --> 32:52.680
Her well-being is no concern to Xiyan.

32:52.760 --> 32:56.320
Seize Qingzhou
and claim the Sacred Mountain.

32:57.040 --> 32:59.280
Only then can I secure immortality.

33:06.600 --> 33:09.240
Yes, Father.

33:29.920 --> 33:31.680
Mingju, how dare you?

33:31.760 --> 33:33.160
I wouldn't, Your Highness.

33:33.240 --> 33:35.000
The Princess Heir has left.

33:35.080 --> 33:37.680
I fear sorrow may overtake you,
making it hard to lead.

33:37.760 --> 33:38.920
Don't overwork yourself.

33:40.240 --> 33:43.640
Come, escort His Highness
back to his quarters.

33:57.840 --> 34:01.520
Mei Lin, you saved my brother,
and I am fond of you.

34:01.600 --> 34:03.920
Can you join our family?

34:07.680 --> 34:09.440
I know you enjoy a drink.

34:09.520 --> 34:12.320
When I'm troubled, I drink as well.

34:12.400 --> 34:14.280
- Cheers, Your Highness.
- Cheers!

34:19.800 --> 34:20.960
Your Highness,

34:24.520 --> 34:25.360
here.

34:26.239 --> 34:27.080
Let's drink.

34:35.520 --> 34:37.440
Mei Lin. Mei Lin.

34:39.120 --> 34:39.960
Mei Lin!

34:41.280 --> 34:42.239
Mei Lin.

34:42.320 --> 34:43.520
Mei Lin.

34:43.600 --> 34:44.679
Mei Lin.

34:44.760 --> 34:46.199
Mei Lin!

34:49.520 --> 34:51.639
Will we meet again in this lifetime?

34:51.719 --> 34:53.360
We'll definitely meet again.

34:59.200 --> 35:01.320
I didn't realize
when we parted in Zhaojing,

35:05.960 --> 35:07.160
it would be the last.

35:24.960 --> 35:27.640
Chagu mentioned Her Highness

35:28.520 --> 35:29.920
didn't pass in pain.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.560
His Majesty truly loved Her Highness.

35:33.320 --> 35:35.560
With His Majesty by her side,

35:36.800 --> 35:38.720
she did not pass in loneliness,

35:41.520 --> 35:42.360
right?

35:58.720 --> 36:01.720
By the gods above, may Zigu

36:02.960 --> 36:05.640
live without restraint in the afterlife.

36:18.280 --> 36:20.440
Your Highness, do you hear?

36:22.320 --> 36:23.560
The gods say yes.

36:40.480 --> 36:41.520
My Lord,

36:43.400 --> 36:44.440
Xiyan has declared war on Great Yan.

37:30.480 --> 37:31.320
Look.

37:31.400 --> 37:32.240
Smoke rises.

37:32.840 --> 37:34.240
What's happening? A mountain fire!

37:35.480 --> 37:36.640
A mountain fire.

37:36.720 --> 37:37.880
It's spreading toward us.

37:37.960 --> 37:38.800
It's getting closer.

37:38.880 --> 37:39.720
Run!

37:42.920 --> 37:45.000
- Run!
- Run now!

37:45.080 --> 37:46.440
There's a fire.

37:46.520 --> 37:49.880
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

38:15.520 --> 38:17.280
- My son!
- Mother!

38:17.360 --> 38:18.320
Mother!

38:19.240 --> 38:20.200
Mother!

38:21.680 --> 38:23.440
Are you alright?

38:23.520 --> 38:25.400
Thank you, Your Excellency.

38:25.480 --> 38:26.720
Let's go quickly!

38:41.200 --> 38:42.200
- What is happening?
- I don't know.

38:42.280 --> 38:43.560
Why can't we leave?

38:43.640 --> 38:45.320
Excuse me. Excuse me.

38:45.400 --> 38:47.120
Excuse me. Excuse me.

38:53.920 --> 38:54.760
Dear townsfolk,

38:55.400 --> 38:58.080
this mountain fire
is a sorrow shared by Qingzhou

38:58.680 --> 39:00.160
and myself.

39:01.160 --> 39:06.240
Now, with both the Xiyan army
and the fire advancing,

39:06.840 --> 39:10.640
only unity will give us hope of survival.

39:11.560 --> 39:14.560
The Weibei Army is clearing trees
to hold back the fire.

39:15.160 --> 39:16.680
All elderly, women, and children

39:16.760 --> 39:18.600
should gather near
the Monument of the Masses.

39:18.680 --> 39:22.080
The Weibei Army will protect you all.

39:22.160 --> 39:23.600
Can you stop the fire?

39:23.680 --> 39:25.480
- Can you really stop it?
- Can you stop it?

39:25.560 --> 39:27.400
My family was lost to the fire

39:27.480 --> 39:29.640
- What should we do?
- ten years ago.

39:29.720 --> 39:31.120
I wish to live!

39:31.200 --> 39:34.600
Will my family's new cabin burn down?

39:34.680 --> 39:35.600
Yes.

39:35.680 --> 39:37.600
- All will be lost.
- We've rebuilt with effort,

39:37.680 --> 39:39.520
only to face ruin again.

39:40.640 --> 39:42.560
We're short on time.

39:42.640 --> 39:44.720
Let's halt the fire with the Weibei Army.

39:45.520 --> 39:47.040
- Yes!
- Yes.

39:47.120 --> 39:49.440
Together, we'll stop the fire!

39:50.360 --> 39:52.480
Your Excellency, I want to join the army.

39:52.560 --> 39:54.040
I'll join the Weibei Army

39:54.120 --> 39:56.080
to fight for Qingzhou and my home.

39:56.680 --> 39:58.320
- I want to join the army too.
- I'm a butcher.

39:58.400 --> 40:00.280
I can kill pigs. I can kill enemies!

40:00.880 --> 40:02.600
- We trust His Excellency.
- We will protect Qingzhou together!

40:02.680 --> 40:03.560
I'm a carpenter.

40:03.640 --> 40:04.760
I can build defenses.

40:04.840 --> 40:06.760
- So can I!
- So can I!

40:06.840 --> 40:08.840
- So can I!
- We will join the Weibei Army!

40:10.920 --> 40:13.600
I, Murong Jinghe, hereby swear,

40:16.760 --> 40:19.600
the Weibei Army will defend Qingzhou
to the death!

40:19.680 --> 40:25.520
Defend Qingzhou to the death!

40:25.600 --> 40:29.880
Defend Qingzhou to the death!

40:29.960 --> 40:31.920
Defend Qingzhou to the death!

40:32.000 --> 40:38.000
Defend Qingzhou to the death!

40:38.800 --> 40:42.360
Your Excellency,
Mingju has an army of 30,000,

40:42.440 --> 40:44.800
but the Weibei Army in Qingzhou
numbers only a thousand.

40:44.880 --> 40:46.080
We must clear the woods
to prevent fire spread,

40:46.160 --> 40:49.600
but if Mingju attacks,
we won't last two days.

40:49.680 --> 40:51.720
General Yin, if you seek
reinforcements in Mozhou,

40:51.800 --> 40:53.040
how soon could they return?

40:54.760 --> 40:55.960
In two days.

40:56.800 --> 40:57.680
You plan to take Youwen Ridge?

40:58.400 --> 41:00.400
- Yes.
- You can't.

41:00.920 --> 41:06.160
It's perilous
and houses Xiyan's ninth division.

41:06.240 --> 41:07.160
We can't go there.

41:07.960 --> 41:10.520
If necessary, we'll break through.

41:13.080 --> 41:15.080
Very well, I trust you.

41:15.160 --> 41:17.800
Qingzhou will hold until your return.

41:18.600 --> 41:19.680
Qingyan,

41:19.760 --> 41:23.560
General Yuan, strengthen the city's
defenses and gather all supplies.

41:23.640 --> 41:25.400
Lord Li Jie will manage deployment.

41:25.480 --> 41:26.480
In the face of a grave threat,

41:26.560 --> 41:28.720
our troops and citizens must remain calm.

41:29.760 --> 41:31.160
- Yes.
- Yes.
